  "tags": ["turn", "commerce"],
  "stats": {"Passos": "4", "Página": "44"},
  "text": "The Commerce phase is when the kingdom generates revenue or makes trade agreements.\n\n### Step 1: Collect Taxes\nYou can [[activity:collect-taxes|Collect Taxes]] once per Kingdom turn to attempt to bolster your Economy-based checks for the remainder of the Kingdom turn. If you don’t attempt to Collect Taxes, you can instead attempt a DC 11 flat check; on a success, reduce Unrest by 1.\n\n### Step 2: Approve Expenses\nYou can draw upon the kingdom’s funds to enhance the standard of living for its citizens by attempting the [[activity:improve-lifestyle|Improve Lifestyle]] activity or you can attempt a withdrawal from the kingdom’s funds using the [[activity:tap-treasury|Tap Treasury]] activity.\n\n### Step 3: Tap Commodities\nIf your kingdom has any stockpiles of Commodities, you can attempt the [[activity:trade-commodities|Trade Commodities]] activity to bolster your RP for the turn.\n\n### Step 4: Manage Trade Agreements\nIf you’ve established trade agreements, you can use the [[activity:manage-trade-agreements|Manage Trade Agreements]] activity.",
