  "text": "The PCs should choose a name for their kingdom. Record it on their kingdom sheet along with the following initial statistics.\n\n- The kingdom’s level (see [[rule:leveling-up-your-kingdom|Leveling Up Your Kingdom]]) is 1, and its maximum level is equal to the party level.\n- The kingdom’s Size ([[rule:kingdom-size|Kingdom Size]]) is 1.\n- The kingdom’s Resource Die ([[rule:resource-dice|Resource Dice]]) is a d4, and its Resource Dice total is 5.\n- The kingdom’s Control DC ([[rule:control-dc|Control DC]]) is 14.\n- The kingdom’s Consumption ([[rule:consumption|Consumption]]) is 0.\n- The kingdom’s Unrest ([[rule:unrest|Unrest]]) is 0.\n- All four Ruins ([[rule:ruin|Ruin]]) start at 0, and each Ruin’s initial threshold is 10.\n- The kingdom’s initial commodity stores ([[rule:commodities|Commodities]]) are 0, and its maximum storage limit for each is 4.",
